### Provider overrides that differ (non-BLE-connect)

| Override | PKG | glasses_app |
|---|---|---|
| `storageNamespace` | `pkg_showcase` | `glasses_app` |
| `externalAuthClientProvider` | real composite client | `UnavailableExternalAuthClient` |
| `deviceAlbumConfigProvider` | static | auth-derived `userId` |
| `deviceAddTypeItemsProvider` | default | glasses-only grid |
