## 3. Shared auto-connect / reconnect logic

### `feature_device_connect` — the only app-start reconnect path

**Gate (fires once after first frame):**

```124:140:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
class _DeviceAutoConnectGateState extends ConsumerState<DeviceAutoConnectGate> {
  @override
  void initState() {
    super.initState();
    WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {
      if (!mounted) return;
      ref.read(deviceAutoConnectControllerProvider.notifier).tryOnce();
    });
  }

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    ref.watch(deviceIdentitySyncControllerProvider);
    return widget.child;
  }
}
```

**`tryOnce()` decision tree:**

```19:55:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
  Future<void> tryOnce() async {
    if (state || ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected) {
      return;
    }
    state = true;

    final devices = ref.read(connectedDevicesProvider);
    if (devices.isEmpty) {
      return;   // ← silent no-op if no app-local history
    }
    final device = devices.first;   // newest known device
    final preflight = await _preflight(device.deviceId, device.name);
    if (!preflight) return;
    // up to 6 connect attempts, 5s apart
    await ref.read(deviceConnectControllerProvider.notifier).connect(
      deviceId: device.deviceId,
      deviceName: device.name,
      source: DeviceConnectSource.autoConnect,
    );
```

**History source** — only written after a **successful connect in this app**:

```8:26:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/connected_devices_controller.dart
const _connectedDevicesKey = 'feature_device_connect.connected_devices';

  List<ConnectedDeviceRecord> build() {
    final raw = ref.read(storageServiceProvider).getString(_connectedDevicesKey);
    // ... decode JSON list, newest-first on recordConnected
```

