```

### `core_ble` — no session restore, no bonded-device scan

**Session always starts disconnected:**

```39:53:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart
  BleSessionState build() {
    // listens to connectionState stream only
    return const BleSessionState();  // disconnected, no deviceId
  }
```

**Connect uses explicit GATT connect, `autoConnect: false`:**

```100:107:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/impl/flutter_blue_ble_service.dart
  Future<Result<BleConnection>> connect(String deviceId) async {
    final device = BluetoothDevice.fromId(deviceId);
    await device.connect(autoConnect: false).timeout(const Duration(seconds: 15));
```

No `connectedPeripherals`, `retrieveConnected`, `getBondedDevices`, or `lastDevice` anywhere in `core_ble`.

### `common_glasses_protocol` — post-connect “reconnect” flag only

After BLE link is up, identity sync sends native handshake with `reconnect: true` if device is in app history:

```48:54:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
    if (event is GlassesConnectRequestEvent) {
      if (event.status == 0 || event.status == 2) {
        await ref.read(glassesCommandSenderProvider).send(
          GlassesOrder.sendConnectRequest(reconnect: _hasCurrentDevice()),
        );
```

```217:235:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/common/common_glasses_protocol/lib/src/protocol/glasses_order.dart
  static List<int> sendConnectRequest({
    required bool reconnect,
    // ...
    reconnect ? 0x01 : 0x00,
```

This is **protocol-level reconnect signaling**, not app-start auto-connect. It also **disconnects** if device identity never arrives (2 × 20s):

```116:125:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
    if (_deviceInfoRetries < _maxDeviceInfoRetries) {
      // retry sendPhoneSystem
    }
    _cancelDeviceInfoWatch();
    await ref.read(bleSessionProvider.notifier).disconnect();
```

